data: {"id": "e9d29066273c459f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1858", "run_id": "e9d29066273c459f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的事实进行综合分析：\n\n**身份与生命周期**\n- Pod `aiops-case-v17/workload` (UID: `85aece07-6ffa-41db-9e5a-f351771a8864`)\n- 状态：`CrashLoopBackOff` (运行于 node2)\n- 容器镜像：`xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n\n**事实证据**\n1.  **探针失败（直接症状）**：\n    - Liveness Probe 持续失败：`Liveness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.36:18080/health\": context deadline exceeded`。\n    - 这意味着容器进程（或应用）虽然可能在启动，但无法及时响应健康检查。\n2.  **容器重启（根因迹象）**：\n    - `kubectl_describe` 显示退出码为 **`Exit Code: 137`** (SIGKILL)。\n    - 这是一个关键点。137 通常意味着", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789396922858, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

